# Prettier expects LF. Without this, core.autocrlf on Windows checks files out as CRLF and `npm run check` fails.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images must never be normalised as text: text=auto only guesses from the first 8 KB.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary

# The engine's mods API types, written by `npm run types:update`: generated, and too long to read in a diff.
tools/claude-code-types/index.d.ts linguist-generated=true -diff
